    { "what": "turning the rotor", "why": "No command moves the wiper in a session. `position` sets it for the whole run, from above 0 at `a` to below 1 at `b`, and the 3D rotor does not turn." },
    { "what": "power rating", "why": "The sheet rates 0.5 W at 70 C, falling to 0 W at 125 C. The engine's potentiometer has no rating, so it never warns." },
